-- 1. join on the date and one more column
Expression ((Project names + Projection))
  MergingAggregated
    GatherExchange
      Aggregating
        Expression (Before GROUP BY)
          JoinLogical (Shuffle HashJoin (co-located by toYYYYMM(#0)) )
            Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
              ReadFromMergeTree (PartitionedRead default.t_coloc_month_left)
            Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
              ReadFromMergeTree (PartitionedRead default.t_coloc_month_right)
1810	2224490	2117700
1810	2224490	2117700
